<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>AntiRecoil - All Weapons High FPS</Major>
    <Description>THIS IS THE BEST RECOILLESS MACRO FOR POINT BLANK.



In the game, what you need to do to get a good burst isn't just to press the fire button, much less to make as many clicks per second as possible, but to click the mouse every 3 bullets you fire, so, with that in mind, this macro has been created so that you can do this without worrying about having the right time to click the mouse in mind. 

Put the macro on your right mouse button, activate it and be happy. 



With the macro activated, all you have to do is hold down the fire button and it will do the recoil control for you.



The timings of this macro are extremely responsive and with a low response time, which means you'll need to have a stable game without FPS drops, with high FPS.

 In the event of lags, anomalies may occur, which will automatically return to normal once stabilized.



If the macro starts firing on its own after you've fired a burst, just click the right button once and it will stop.

Thanks for using it, buddy

Peace</Description>
    <Comment>Macro in-game is not forbidden, but there is a possibility of a ban if someone films you for macro abuse.

However, with macros such as no recoil, there's definitely no way of proving that you're using them, as you could simply be a god and have absurd control over your aim, so in all cases, use caution.</Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
Delay 1 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 1 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 1 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 1 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 1 ms
LeftUp 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Point blank</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>